title:
Consideration of a Release of the Conservation Easement for Lot 70 in Armand Beach East Subdivision. The Board of County Commissioners may:- Approve the Release of Easement releasing the Conservation Easement for Lot 70, Armand Beach East Subdivision (only Lot 70);
- Approve the Release of Easement releasing the Conservation Easement within the Armand Beach East Subdivision (entire easement);
- Not Approve either Release of Easement, leaving the Conservation Easement in place; or
- Continue consideration of the Request to Release the Easement for Lot 70 to a time and date certain on the basis that additional information is necessary for the Board to be able to make a decision on this request.
